# File Organization Structure

This project is a monorepo with two main top-level packages:
- `web/`: Frontend SPA (React, Vite, Tailwind, TypeScript)
- `server/`: Backend API (Node.js, TypeScript, LoopBack 4)

```
web/
├── public/
│   ├── bike-example/
│   └── bpmn-xml-examples/
├── src/
│   ├── assets/
│   ├── components/
│   │   └── bpmn/
│   ├── routes/
│   │   └── bpmn/
│   ├── types/
│   └── ...
├── package.json
└── ...

server/
├── src/
│   ├── controllers/
│   ├── datasources/
│   ├── models/
│   ├── repositories/
│   └── __tests__/
├── package.json
└── ...
```

# Import/Export Guidelines
- Use ESM imports/exports exclusively
- Use named exports for components and utilities
- Use default exports sparingly (mainly for main components)
- Group imports: React → third-party → internal → types → styles
